# M19-100: A 100-Question Benchmark for Topic 19 (Energy Management)

M19-100 is a benchmark of 100 questions with reference answers, built from the
**main text of the fifth edition of Topic 19 (Energy Management)** of the Iranian
National Building Regulations. It was created to evaluate retrieval-augmented
question answering (RAG) and automatic answer judges for regulatory text.

This repository accompanies the paper:

> A. Akoushideh, "Validity of Automatic Judges for RAG Question Answering on the
> Iranian National Building Regulations, Topic 19 (Energy Management): Benchmark
> Bias, Error-Type Analysis and Real-Answer Validation," IEEE Access, [year/status].

## Contents

- **M19-100 questions and reference answers**: 100 questions, each with a reference
  answer taken from the text. Language: Persian.
